# Skill pack links, generated by bin/wire-skills.  A symlink cannot hold `~`,
# so a committed link would carry one machine's absolute home path; the links
# are therefore machine-local and the generator is the tracked part.  The
# README stays as the convention's signpost.
.agents/skills/*
!.agents/skills/README.md
